    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$path_intro",
        "key": "$path_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We've got a crowd here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, we do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_073",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_072",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But I don't know what language they're speaking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So should we just let them follow us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you have a better idea?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We could kill them all?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You think you can get Frost and Dan to go along with that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2003_Frost_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Strumming and singing)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_072",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "&*......%$ ....& (W-What is this sound? And why do I like it so much?!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_072",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "&%......% (I've never heard anything like it...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2002_Dan_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, how is everybody?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you tell me what language you're speaking?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, but I guess even if you told me, I still wouldn't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_073",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......%&$ (Where did they come from?!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_073",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "$......&# (And why does this one look so weird?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria D"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, at least there are people here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I just hope there's a place we can resupply.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wishful thinking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're outsiders?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? You speak Sargonian?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, it looks like you're definitely outsiders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Our car died, so we're looking for someone with the Arts to recharge it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Come with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "See, Aya, that was more than just wishful thinking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine. I guess the world is a magical place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_village_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2002_Dan_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey hey hey! What's this?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a village here in the middle of this primeval forest!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2003_Frost_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Humming)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's really amazing. You can see the influence of modern architecture on most of the buildings, but they still have that primitive beauty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2004_Alty_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's odd, but very special.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am the leader of this tribe, Zumama. Most of my people can understand your language.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can have some of our priests recharge your vehicle, but there are terms.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What terms?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to look inside your vehicle, at its structure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Is that all?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you sure you won't break it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm pretty sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alty?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2004_Alty_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not like we have a choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Agreed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good. High Priest...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_074"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm here! ...Oh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmmmmm....?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know of you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_074",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I know of you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never expected to see your kind here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_074",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, honestly, I was thinking the exact same thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'm more interested in your vehicle than you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_074",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "By all means.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I said it before and I'll say it again. The world is a magical place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to say, I agree.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "At the same time, Frost hooks her guitar up to the ceremonial speaker and improvises a solo."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2004_Alty_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nice, Frost.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2003_Frost_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "This village is inspiring me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2002_Dan_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Awesome, Frost, you really switched up the melody this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2003_Frost_rock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$bat_Imfxingback_intro",
        "key": "$bat_Imfxingback_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Heat, repressed...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll call this song... 'D'!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's that sound coming from?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it?I can feel it energizing me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "text": "It must be the outsiders who just came! Let's go see!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There are more of them, Alty...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2003_Frost_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "These lives thirst for music! For energy! For...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a voice!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Outsider, give us more music!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alty... I know it's unexpected, but I think the atmosphere here is actually really good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why don't we get out the amps and play together?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess that would be fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2002_Dan_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, can't let Frost take all the glory!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "text": "I gotta get in on such a badass track!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2004_Alty_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then let the locals feel the music of AUS!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just a few notes, but I'm too excited to sit still!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "text": "It might be like what the priests do, it's called 'music'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never heard anything like it! Who are these people?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know, they must be 'Cuicayotl'!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria D"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2002_Dan_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Cuicayotl'? What's that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_074"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, that's how you say 'one who sings' in their language.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's been a long time since they had a 'Cuicayotl' here, and you've won them over with your music.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I must say, your music is vastly different from that of any other 'Cuicayotl' I've ever heard before!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "But no matter. I find yours a lot more fun!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Cuicayotl', give us another song!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria E"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll give you anything! Just one more song!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria F"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do we do, Alty?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2002_Dan_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's stay here, Alty!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2004_Alty_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I can't let you forget our goal...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, fine. We've got time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_jungle_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$path_intro",
        "key": "$path_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never imagined there would be a Messenger here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And I never thought AUS, from all the magazine covers, would show up here either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's Zumama?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She's making the speaker system you asked for. So I'll be taking you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "How long are you going to stay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe a week, maybe a month, maybe a whole year.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "text": "This place is doing it for us. I think we can have some fun here, at least.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then this is the right place for you to put on a show.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_temple_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2002_Dan_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "So cool!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2004_Alty_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's... some kind of temple?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. This is where all the tribes used to gather for the 'Mahuizzotia', but it hasn't been used since Gavial left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Mahuizzotia'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2004_Alty_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial? That name came up at Rhodes Island... No, it's probably just a common name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can perform here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2003_Frost_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're going to give the people the best music they've ever heard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2002_Dan_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, hahaha! Yes! We'll leave the mark of AUS right here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_village_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Two months later..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "AUS is unbelievable...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "They actually did stay for two whole months.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Gavial ever comes back, she's going to be blown away by the music we have way out here now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "The people fell in love with their rock and roll.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "So what are they going to perform for us today?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I wonder maybe if I'm their biggest fan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "AUS...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The room is empty. All the toiletries and bedding are neat and tidy, with a piece of paper resting on the table in the center."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're gone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a note on the table. Let's see...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "'We left. Don't miss us. I hope you enjoyed the music. Also, we left all our records here for you. Have fun. -AUS'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Heh, they really are unbelievable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
