        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$farce_intro",
        "key": "$farce_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2004_Alty_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think I'll ever forget that Acahualla place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2003_Frost_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Humming) It was definitely unforgettable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the people there are really noisy, and wild.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2002_Dan_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah? I love them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course you do. I don't think you'd mind if we left you there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I was definitely thinking about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you think those people have a kind of natural, primal energy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Out of all the countries and cities we've been to, I've never seen people like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "text": "I love 'em!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
        "name2": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, you're right about that much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2003_Frost_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "They really get our music. They're the best audience we've ever had.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2004_Alty_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think Frost likes them too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we can't just show up and flip a whole civilization upside-down. We should stick to singing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sing for them. If it sounds good\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2002_Dan_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then they'll sing too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2001_Aya_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't we say that before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "npc_2004_Alty_rock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who knows? We might've said it a million times already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go. Continue on our journey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we sing to the world, will she listen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Alty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A few of the bandmates joke around for a bit, until the car goes silent."
    },
    {
        "text": "Alty looks at the key in her hand, 'Dr. Kal'tsit, can that Rhodes Island of yours give the world the answer it's looking for?'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
